 "phrases": [
  "You talked about sneakers. Ten minutes later, a sneaker ad. Coincidence?",
  "Is your phone secretly listening to you? Let's open it up.",
  "Your phone's microphone is always on. But only one tiny part is listening.",
  "A low-power chip waits for one thing only. Your wake word.",
  "Until it hears it, the sound is thrown away. Never sent anywhere.",
  "So did anyone actually check? Yes.",
  "Researchers tested more than seventeen thousand Android apps, looking for secret recordings.",
  "They found no app secretly sending audio.",
  "But they found something else. A few apps were sending recordings of your screen.",
  "Then in twenty twenty-four, a marketing company claimed it could listen to target ads.",
  "The FTC investigated. The tool never did what it promised.",
  "So how did they know about the sneakers?",
  "Your location. Your searches. The friend you were with, who searched them too.",
  "They don't need your voice. Your data already says enough.",
  "Quick check: an orange or green dot on your screen means the mic is on.",
